      "name": "Here Comes the Boom",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "action",
        "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to have the @Lookup[@name] unleash a storm of lightning and thunder. Make an attack roll against <strong>1d4+1</strong> targets within Far range. Targets the @Lookup[@name] succeeds against take <strong>3d12</strong> magic damage. Then each target within Far range of the @Lookup[@name] must make an Agility Reaction Roll (20). Targets who fail take <strong>3d8</strong> physical damage and are pushed back to Close range. Targets who succeed must mark a Stress.</p>",
        "attribution": {},
